Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.47,0:00:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Diablo! Your moves!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.01,0:00:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.97,0:01:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,This four-way duel is nuts!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.55,0:01:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Each duelist can attack\Nany of the other three!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.49,0:01:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,True, but each duelist can also\Ndefend any of the other three.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.91,0:01:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how Yugi saved Joey from\NKaiba's attack. Hey, Wheeler!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.43,0:01:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time you won't be so lucky!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.85,0:01:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the help, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.95,0:01:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't let Joey lose!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.91,0:01:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,If he does, he may have to\Nface Merrick in the semifinals!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.93,0:01:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,And so far, all of Marek's opponents\Nhave ended up in pretty bad shape, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.25,0:01:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,this tournament of yours is far more\Ndangerous than you could ever understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.43,0:01:37.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What is he babbling about?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.49,0:01:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I know what I need to do to win this\Ntournament, and I've had it planned all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.25,0:01:45.39,Default,,0,0,0,,First, I have to use my Egyptian god card,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.67,0:01:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Obelisk the Tormenter,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.07,0:01:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,To defeat Yugi in the semifinals and\Ntake Slifer the Sky Dragon from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.87,0:01:55.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Then my deck will be powerful\Nenough to crush Marek in
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.35,0:01:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,the finals and obtain the most\Npowerful Egyptian god card,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.35,0:02:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,the Winged Dragon of Ra.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.69,0:02:06.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll finally prove that I am the greatest\Nduelist the world has ever known.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.55,0:02:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,not Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.65,0:02:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,And with all three Egyptian god\Ncards in my deck, I'll be unbeatable.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.47,0:02:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It's pretty quiet in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.45,0:02:17.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone must be planning\Ntheir strategies.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.61,0:02:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, mine's a no-brainer.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.43,0:02:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta get me a piece of Marek.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.33,0:02:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,When this thing started, I promised\NYugi that I'd help him take Marek down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.35,0:02:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,And if I face that evil\Nfreak in the semifinals,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.91,0:02:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I can knock him out of the tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.93,0:02:33.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus, beating Marek might bring\NMai back from the Shadow Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.19,0:02:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's another promise I can't break.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.65,0:02:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You and I had an agreement, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.15,0:02:44.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I let you down, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.27,0:02:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,But I promise, I'm gonna\Nget you out of this mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.83,0:02:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Marek's done enough damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.25,0:02:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's time for Joey Wheeler\Nto dish it right back to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.53,0:02:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, Wheeler. Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.49,0:02:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,An amateur duelist like you\Ncan't afford to be daydreaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.97,0:02:59.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I was strategizing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.51,0:03:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,But to do that, you have to understand\Nhow to play the game, Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.47,0:03:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.38,0:03:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I got a game for you right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.17,0:03:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,When are you going to realize\Nthat you don't have what
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.55,0:03:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,it takes to compete in my\Ntournament and you never will?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.79,0:03:14.51,Default,,0,0,0,,And there's only one reason\Nthat you made it this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.59,0:03:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's because your little friend\NYugi keeps bailing you out. Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.25,0:03:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You're hopeless.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.73,0:03:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,And if you ask me, I'd say that\NYugi knows that as well. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.53,0:03:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.93,0:03:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Why else would Yugi waste his\Ntrap card to protect you, Wheeler?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.29,0:03:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Because he doesn't believe\Nyou can protect yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.21,0:03:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,And he's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.51,0:03:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only don't you have the\Nskills to get through this,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.39,0:03:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,you're also the only finalist\Nwithout an Egyptian god card.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.23,0:03:45.07,Default,,0,0,0,,And Yugi knows that the\Nonly way you'll ever make
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.15,0:03:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,it past the semifinals\Nis if he duels for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.33,0:03:50.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Or perhaps he wants to\Nduel against you next
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.97,0:03:54.61,Default,,0,0,0,,round because he knows it's\Nan easy victory. That's a lie!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.95,0:03:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I think Yugi's just afraid to admit that\Nhe hasn't believed in you from the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.77,0:04:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,And I don't blame him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.97,0:04:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.88,0:04:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,This time your taunting\Nhas gone way over the line!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.97,0:04:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.17,0:04:09.35,Default,,0,0,0,,If you really want to prove me wrong,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.53,0:04:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,why don't you stop protecting\Nyour friend and let him
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.19,0:04:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,finish this duel using his own\Npathetic skills for a change? Kaiba!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.59,0:04:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a second, Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.63,0:04:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.17,0:04:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for trying to help\Nme out, but Kaiba's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.05,0:04:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta prove I can take care of myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.35,0:04:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,If I'm gonna win this tournament\Nand help you save the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.59,0:04:30.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta do it on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.45,0:04:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Just be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.05,0:04:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll show Kaiba that Joey\NWheeler depends on no one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.45,0:04:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Without Yugi to shield him,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.35,0:04:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,that second-rate duelist will\Nlose his light points in no time,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.97,0:04:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,allowing me to destroy\NYugi in the next round.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.47,0:04:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.33,0:05:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You're one of the strongest people\NI know, and you'll get through this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.93,0:05:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,She's been an inspiration to\Nme since the day I met her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.03,0:05:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.01,0:05:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Cross on the green, not in between!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.93,0:05:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, you've got to help us!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.51,0:05:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,A gang of robed weirdos is after us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.85,0:05:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got to keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.09,0:05:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Serenity.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.07,0:05:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Serenity?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.07,0:05:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.27,0:05:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You're Joey's sister, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.95,0:05:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady, we don't have time\Nto play meet and greet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.79,0:05:28.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you we're being\Nchased by a bunch of thugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.69,0:05:30.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, guys, hop in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.09,0:05:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon, I'll be able to\Ntake my bandages off.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.15,0:05:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll finally be able\Nto see my brother Joey duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.11,0:05:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I just can't wait, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.87,0:05:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to say, I'm surprised a knucklehead\Nlike Joey has such a sweet sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.53,0:05:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Then again, he does have a soft side,\Nand he can be charming when he wants to.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.29,0:05:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Soft side? Charming?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.77,0:05:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I first met him on the\Nway to Duelist Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.59,0:05:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,All Joey could talk about was\Nhow he was going to win the
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.99,0:06:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,tournament so he could use the\Nprize money for your operation,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.33,0:06:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Serenity.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.24,0:06:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to admit, his story was touching.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.11,0:06:06.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey's the best!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.49,0:06:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd say it runs in the family.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.85,0:06:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey's out there in the Battle City\NFinals dueling with all his heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.53,0:06:17.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like he did at Duelist Kingdom, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.89,0:06:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Only this time, he's doing it to\Nbring you back from the Shadow Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.17,0:06:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You're safe now, Odeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.23,0:06:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to Merrick's good side.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.17,0:06:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.63,0:06:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.57,0:06:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Teya?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.55,0:06:40.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.63,0:06:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Sister, it's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.07,0:06:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Your brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.53,0:06:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You are Merrick?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.49,0:06:50.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Protect Odeon from my dark half.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.29,0:06:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,For without Odeon, the evil force\Nwill control my body forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.35,0:06:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,My brother was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.25,0:07:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,As his sworn protector, Odeon was able to\Ncontain the darkness deep within Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.53,0:07:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But when the winged dragon of\NRa knocked Odeon unconscious,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.51,0:07:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick's evil side completely took over.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.97,0:07:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Just as it did so many years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.59,0:07:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,On the night my father punished\NOdeon for disobeying his orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.23,0:07:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.15,0:07:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,That was the first time I\Nwitnessed my brother's dark side.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.31,0:07:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Odeon?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.65,0:07:29.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You're all right now, Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.39,0:07:32.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Odeon held the darkness back,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.45,0:07:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,but not before Merrick sent\Nour father to the Shadow Realm,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.39,0:07:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,forcing me to inherit the Millennium\NNecklace before my time had come.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.15,0:07:50.51,Default,,0,0,0,,At that moment,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.87,0:07:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,The doors to the future were opened up to\Nme, and I saw Merrick's destiny unfold.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.89,0:08:00.59,Default,,0,0,0,,That was the future And\Naccording to my vision,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.75,0:08:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,the worst is yet to come\NAnd my vision was correct
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.77,0:08:08.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick rejected his\Nduties as a tomb keeper And
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.19,0:08:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,attempted to steal all three\NEgyptian god cards It was
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.13,0:08:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,all part of his plan to seize\Nthe power of the pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.79,0:08:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,First, Merak took the winged\Ndragon of Ra from its hiding place.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.71,0:08:22.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Then he stole Slifer, the sky dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.61,0:08:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,All he needed was Obelisk, the tormentor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.43,0:08:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent work, my rare hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.49,0:08:37.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Now open the vault.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.69,0:08:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to obtain the\Nthird Egyptian god card.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.91,0:08:45.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You have arrived too late, my brother
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.95,0:08:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,The card you seek is no\Nlonger in this vault. Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.51,0:08:56.49,Default,,0,0,0,,if it isn't my sister What an\Nunexpected surprise Now tell me,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.71,0:08:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,what have you done with Obelisk? Merrick,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.67,0:09:02.43,Default,,0,0,0,,the Egyptian god cards\Ndon't belong to you Nor
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.51,0:09:05.57,Default,,0,0,0,,does the sacred power of\Nthe pharaoh The pharaoh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.81,0:09:09.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I refuse to waste my\Nlife away waiting for him
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.17,0:09:13.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time for me to take my\Ndestiny in my own hands, Ishizu.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.91,0:09:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,So hand the card over to me, right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.41,0:09:18.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough, Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.77,0:09:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a tomb keeper, remember? Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.19,0:09:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,How can I forget?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.67,0:09:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,The day I was initiated,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.41,0:09:31.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I was charged with carrying the secret\Nof the pharaoh's power on my back,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.05,0:09:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,as our father did before me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.85,0:09:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that tradition ends here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.73,0:09:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.64,0:09:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no use opposing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.79,0:09:47.01,Default,,0,0,0,,sister The power of my millennium rod\Nalways gets me what I want So I'll only ask
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.09,0:09:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,you nicely one more\Ntime What have you done
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.03,0:09:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,with the last remaining Egyptian god card,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.75,0:09:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,my dear sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.97,0:09:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother, I shall never reveal that
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.55,0:10:04.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll find it, Ishizu.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.73,0:10:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Odeon?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.93,0:10:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.27,0:10:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid you made a very\Nfoolish choice today, Yishizu.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.43,0:10:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Odeon!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.25,0:10:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Help him
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.49,0:10:27.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You know as well as I do that Merrick\Nhas an even stronger evil deep within him
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.73,0:10:34.49,Default,,0,0,0,,And only you can keep\Nit from surfacing, Odeon
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.23,0:10:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,But when Odeon lost\Nconsciousness, my brother was
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.11,0:10:44.97,Default,,0,0,0,,consumed by that evil\Nhowever now i understand
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.05,0:10:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,that these events were\Ndestined to occur just as
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.25,0:10:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,yugi was destined to complete\Nthe millennium puzzle
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.65,0:10:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,and pegasus was destined to\Ncreate the game of dual monsters
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.99,0:11:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,And Seto Kaiba was destined to\Nreceive Obelisk the Tormentor
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.97,0:11:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,And I was destined to give my necklace\Naway I can only hope that it's my brother
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.07,0:11:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick's destiny. To be saved from the\Ndarkness that now controls his body.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.07,0:11:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright you two,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.87,0:11:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,it's time for me to take\Ncharge of this duel And
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.51,0:11:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,since the first two duelists\Nto lose will face each
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.57,0:11:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Other in the semi-finals.\NI know exactly what I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.09,0:11:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,To do to ensure that I face\Nthe Pharaoh. It's my move.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.47,0:11:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make sure Kaiba and Little\NJoey fall first. I place one
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.63,0:11:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Card face down. Then I'll summon\NLord Poison in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.71,0:11:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,And now I'll attack you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.25,0:11:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba So prepare to be the first unfortunate\Nsoul to feel the wrath of my deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.73,0:12:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you ready? Noodoria!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.29,0:12:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack his Force Raider now!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.65,0:12:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.57,0:12:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,He's attacking me with a monster\Nthat is weaker than mine?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.51,0:12:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick's monster must have\Nsome kind of a special ability!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.87,0:12:16.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice try, fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.45,0:12:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Force Raider!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.91,0:12:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Counter-attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.79,0:12:28.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You fell into my trap when\NNewdoria goes to the graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.63,0:12:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I can destroy any monster on the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.73,0:12:34.31,Default,,0,0,0,,So say goodbye to your Force Raider.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.37,0:12:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.51,0:12:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Now Kaiba's wide open.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.41,0:12:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I can blast his life\Npoints in my next turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.55,0:12:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not done yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.47,0:12:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, which one of my cards\Nshould I unleash first?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.87,0:12:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I activate Spell of Pain, but\Nwho should I direct it towards?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.49,0:13:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.29,0:13:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I'll use my card on little Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.85,0:13:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you lose the points I would have\Nlost when my monster was destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.79,0:13:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.87,0:13:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.19,0:13:23.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll try, but I'm not exactly a\Nfan of high places. Come on, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.23,0:13:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been in much scarier\Nspots than this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.77,0:13:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay strong, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.99,0:13:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only a 600-foot drop.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.59,0:13:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Gee, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.01,0:13:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what's worse, losing this\Nduel or falling out of this chair.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.53,0:13:38.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I have both Kaiba and little\NJoey exactly where I want them,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.73,0:13:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,so I'm sure to duel the\NPharaoh in the next round.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.77,0:13:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll seize his Millennium\NPuzzle and his Egyptian God card.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.03,0:13:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Your move, Pharaoh. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.45,0:13:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba has no monsters\Ndefending him This is
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.33,0:13:55.85,Default,,0,0,0,,the perfect chance to\Nattack his life points
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.93,0:13:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, behold,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.73,0:14:01.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba I sacrificed Big Shield Gardener
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.57,0:14:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,To summon my Beast of Dilfer, And now,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.31,0:14:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,my beast Prepare yourself\Nfor an assault Beast of
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.91,0:14:14.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Slifer, attack Kaiba's life\Npoints directly! Zato, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.83,0:14:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess again Your tactics are obvious!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.57,0:14:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Observe!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.63,0:14:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You triggered my trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.83,0:14:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,And thanks to my card,\NAttack Guidance Armor,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.91,0:14:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll redirect your attack to any\Nmonster on the playing field!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.77,0:14:34.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, of course, I could easily target\Nyour Beast of Guilt for Yugi. Or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.59,0:14:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.81,0:14:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.19,0:14:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Kaiba's trap card can only\Ntarget monsters, which means I'm safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.49,0:14:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.40,0:14:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Obviously, my target is going to be...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.63,0:14:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Poison, Marek's only monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.11,0:14:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Marek, I aim\NYugi's attack at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.91,0:14:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.15,0:14:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Not if I activate this mirror force.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.05,0:15:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What? No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.95,0:15:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, so I'm able to reflect\Nthe attack back at Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.71,0:15:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,So your monster's destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.77,0:15:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.79,0:15:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I activate my trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.89,0:15:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Seven tools of the bandit!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.17,0:15:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,My car deactivates your mirror force.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.11,0:15:21.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice try, Merrick, but your\Ntrap didn't work. Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.83,0:15:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, this tool's intense.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.93,0:15:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,My brother redirected\NYugi's attack to Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.75,0:15:40.47,Default,,0,0,0,,and then Merrick tried to\Nreflect that attack back to Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.55,0:15:43.65,Default,,0,0,0,,But it didn't work, so Marek\Ntook the damage anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.51,0:15:47.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Marek, your life points\Njust went down by 700.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.93,0:15:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,So go up there with the other chump.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.29,0:15:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Now Marek's tied with me, so I\Nmay face him in the semifinals.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.61,0:15:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not the only one\Nwho loses life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.75,0:16:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You played Seven Tools\Nof the Bandit, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.63,0:16:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,That card costs you 1,000 life\Npoints, so your chair rises as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.27,0:16:08.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm aware of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.35,0:16:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.81,0:16:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi has to win so he can duel me next!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.39,0:16:16.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi's in last place now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.21,0:16:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I know, but I think he lost those\Nlife points on purpose, Taya!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.89,0:16:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, the first two duelists to\Nlose face each other in the semi-finals!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.63,0:16:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi's still planning to protect Wheeler\Nfrom dueling against Marek! My move!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.17,0:16:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,If I don't draw a monster now,\Nthis turn is gonna be my last!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.65,0:16:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, I need a winner!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.57,0:16:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Here it goes!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.99,0:16:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.90,0:16:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon Gear Freed, the\NIron Knight, in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.35,0:16:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,About time he got a monster on the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.89,0:16:49.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, way to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.51,0:16:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that I got a monster, it's\Ntime to do a little damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.97,0:16:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.37,0:16:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,All three of them blew their\Nface down cards last turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.55,0:17:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,And those two have no\Nmonsters on the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.67,0:17:02.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I could blast Maric.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.95,0:17:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah, I got a better idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.05,0:17:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going for Rich Boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.25,0:17:08.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this, Kaiba!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.07,0:17:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, tear free to attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.21,0:17:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Go straight for his life, boys!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.11,0:17:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,This'll put Kaiba in last place!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.29,0:17:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Big brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.69,0:17:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, all right!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.15,0:17:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Wheeler, I assure you, you\Nwon't be laughing much longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.39,0:17:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.39,0:17:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Last I checked, you wanted to go to\Nthe top of your duel tower, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.39,0:17:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did Joey attack Kaiba?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.75,0:17:41.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Now Kaiba and I are closest to the top,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.31,0:17:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,and Joey and Merrick are\Nclosest to the bottom!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.47,0:17:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.67,0:17:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey must want to face\NMerrick in the semifinals!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.57,0:17:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You're mine, Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.09,0:17:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time for you to pay\Nfor what you did to Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.29,0:17:58.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.71,0:18:02.19,Default,,0,0,0,,As soon as I crush Merrick, I'll get\Nyour mind back from the Shadow Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.27,0:18:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,just like I promised.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.75,0:18:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,For my last move, I'll place one\Ncard face down and end my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.21,0:18:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,About time. My move.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.71,0:18:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,If I want to face Yugi in the semi-finals,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.95,0:18:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,all I have to do is make sure that he\Nand I both lose this four-way duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.19,0:18:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,,But I can't let myself\Nlose a duel on purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.17,0:18:26.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll place three cards face\Ndown on the field and then
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.51,0:18:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll summon the mighty\NBlade Knight in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.25,0:18:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't throw this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.13,0:18:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to lose more life points, Marek. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.29,0:18:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Blade Knight, attack Marek directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.41,0:18:51.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Going up. Aw, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.95,0:18:54.85,Default,,0,0,0,,This hurts my chances of\Nfacing Marek in the next round.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.93,0:18:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,This four-way duel's confusing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.37,0:19:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it seems like everyone's\Ntrying to duel somebody else.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.95,0:19:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you're not afraid of heights,\NMarek, because it's a long way to the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.45,0:19:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make sure Marek and Wheeler lose this\Nduel, so I face Yuge in the semi-finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.43,0:19:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll prove once and for all that I am\Na far better duelist than he'll ever be.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.23,0:19:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll pit my Obelisk, the Tormentor,\Nagainst his Slifer, the Sky Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.43,0:19:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,And when these two Egyptian gods clash,\NYuge will learn what torment is all about.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.25,0:20:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you.
